note """inference arm: an ALIASED import binds under its alias rather than under the package's own declared name, and every routing shape that names no reference — tee, drop, loop and send — passes its payload through. THE LAST LEG PINS THE FIXED POINT: `spread` consumes the loop label `retry` and is declared ABOVE the send that feeds it, so `again` and `later` are typed only because the walk iterates. A single forward pass in statement order leaves them untyped."""
import ord "example.com/inference/subject/orderpkg/v2"

flow routes
source ingest ord.Listen[ord.Order](":8080")
transform scored ord.Score from ingest
tee fan from scored -> keep, toss
loop retry
tee spread from retry -> again, later
send keep -> retry
drop toss
sink out ord.Store from again, later
